<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Fixture STIG for the SQL Server 2016 instance rule types, trimmed to a representative handful
    of each from PowerStig's own SqlServer-2016-Instance-3.6 data. The 2016 STIG is the one that
    carries all five Sql* rule types plus the Registry and SecurityOption types it shares with the
    Windows STIGs, so this is where the shared instances list is proved to reach every one of them.

    The rules are kept as upstream writes them - only the STIG prose and the legacy ids are
    dropped. V-213969 is upstream's own duplicate of V-213968 and is kept as one: a duplicate
    produces no task, which is only visible over a whole conversion.
-->
